{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1499","id":4018820758,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vilaW","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1499","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1499.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1499.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1499","number":1499,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"harden paper workspace tenant isolation","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis PR hardens Paper Workspace tenant isolation across the service-role read path and authenticated Supabase/RLS access.\n\nThe leak path was that the paper workspace route authenticated the learner and passed `userId` into the read service, but topic artifacts were loaded through the service client by topic only. Because service-role access bypasses RLS, same-topic artifacts from another learner could be folded into paper workspace pinned summaries and topic workspace residency projections. The SQL paper workspace projection had the same topic-only join against `learning_artifacts`.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Adds learner ownership to `learning_artifacts` with `user_id`, backfilled from `learning_sessions.user_id` and `attempts.user_id` where those source links exist.\n- Adds a learner/topic/residency index for artifact reads.\n- Makes `listArtifactsByTopic` fail closed without `userId` and filter by both `user_id` and `canonical_home_topic_id`.\n- Threads authenticated `userId` through paper workspace reads, legacy topic workspace reads, artifact lifecycle patching, paper entry artifact resolution, and session artifact anchors.\n- Recreates learner-facing workspace views with `security_invoker = true`.\n- Fixes `learning_paper_workspace_projection` so pinned artifact summaries join artifacts by both topic and learner ownership: `a.canonical_home_topic_id = ts.topic_id` and `a.user_id = pw.user_id`.\n- Adds RLS policies for paper workspaces, paper topic sections, topic workspaces, workspace slots, artifacts, and artifact content versions.\n- Adds regression and schema-contract tests for same-topic cross-user artifact isolation.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath api/learning/__tests__/workspace-read-service.paper-projection.test.js api/learning/__tests__/artifact-repository.test.js api/learning/__tests__/schema-contract.test.js`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath api/learning/__tests__/artifact-service.test.js api/learning/__tests__/artifact-api.test.js api/learning/__tests__/workspace-read-service.lifecycle-boundary.test.js api/learning/__tests__/workspace-read-service.topic-projection.test.js api/learning/__tests__/workspace-repository.test.js`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath api/learning/__tests__/session-api.test.js`\n- `npm run supabase:audit:rls`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nThe session API test needed local-server bind permission in this sandbox; it passed when rerun with that permission.","created_at":"2026-07-09T02:18:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T03:17:44Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T03:14:26Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T03:14:26Z","merge_commit_sha":"d9e8ba0684872293e930b8144b434d23f6f3ed82","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1499/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1499/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1499/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/914fecf1b993eb74b872809649ba25a921867d0b","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/paper-workspace-tenant-isolation","ref":"codex/paper-workspace-tenant-isolation","sha":"914fecf1b993eb74b872809649ba25a921867d0b","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":999357095,"node_id":"R_kgDOO5D6pw","name":"cieco